      "message": "Removed.\n\nWithout this condition, art_apex_test.py was failing. But confirmed that putting \"compressible: false\" in art_apex here[1] is enough to avoid compressing art APEX and failing that test.\n\nAll bootstrap APEX will have compressible set to false. I will upload them on follow up CLs.\n\n[1] https://source.corp.google.com/android/art/build/apex/Android.bp;l\u003d260?q\u003d%22name:%20%5C%22com.android.art%5C%22%22%20package:android$\u0026sq\u003dpackage:android",
